 "verdict": "AR: THE PROMPT IS ERASED. Random and corpus seeds settle to the same composition (max top-1 gap 0.053), and only 2% of the corpus seed survives in place. So the settled state does NOT remember what it started from, and #93's novelty-from-noise is representative rather than one basin among many. SEPARATELY, a ring filled with the attractor token is a TRAP in 2/6 cells -- self-sustaining once entered. But since neither random nor text seeds reach it, its basin is negligible, which is exactly why F67 found no transition: an absorbing state you never arrive at produces none. MLM: THE PROMPT IS ERASED. Random and corpus seeds settle to the same composition (max top-1 gap 0.022), and only 12% of the corpus seed survives in place. So the settled state does NOT remember what it started from, and #93's novelty-from-noise is representative rather than one basin among many. SEPARATELY, a ring filled with the attractor token is a TRAP in 6/6 cells -- self-sustaining once entered. But since neither random nor text seeds reach it, its basin is negligible, which is exactly why F67 found no transition: an absorbing state you never arrive at produces none.",
